  body: "# Winter Fuel Payment guidance for claims before 16 September 2024\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe
    first chapter 40 section expressly limits itself to Winter Fuel Payment claims before 16 September 2024 and
    describes annual payment by reference to a qualifying week.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe prominent source
    warning says this guidance no longer applies and is retained for earlier claims or appeals. The date does not
    govern the whole PDF: the later section separately covers a 2024–2025 period. Historical overseas and benefit
    conditions are not current entitlement instructions.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 40000, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=2).\n\
    - [DMG 40001, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=2).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=2).\n\
    - [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch40`:
    PDF `9b76037acc6c9d2fc308b1cf7f834f2d023277e0a08757925e62255b3aa71dd3`; extracted pages `3e67a94776dd0edb568cbaca4d63bfef2587ca81bb5b154aad552d488c8de249`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.419769Z`.\n"
